  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Bioenergy Value Chain Innovations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Normal   0               21         false   false   false      EN-US   X-NONE   X-NONE                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  /* Style Definitions */  table.MsoNormalTable  {mso-style-name:&quot;Table Normal&quot;;  mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0;  mso-tstyle-colband-size:0;  mso-style-noshow:yes;  mso-style-priority:99;  mso-style-parent:&quot;&quot;;  mso-padding-alt:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;  mso-para-margin:0cm;  mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt;  mso-pagination:widow-orphan;  font-size:10.0pt;  font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;  mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;  mso-ansi-language:EN-US;  mso-fareast-language:EN-US;}    The Project is anticipated to produce a range of co-benefits. Consistent with the EBRD&#x2019;s mandate to support transition, the Project will offer significant socioeconomic benefits across the country, including those associated with resource savings and efficiency gains by replacing fossil fuels with sustainable biomass. These will contribute to increasing the competitiveness of local agribusiness and assist in future-proofing these climate change risks through both investments in sustainable agribusiness and awareness raising.  By focusing on waste utilisation, the Project will provide various benefits for the local private agricultural sector. It will focus on adding value to production residues which will be processed through sustainable energy production systems and thus decrease environmental pressure and reduce GHG emissions.  The Project has significant potential in adding to the overall country&#x2019;s energy security. As noted throughout the document, Ukraine has massive energy potential embedded in its agribiomass and the Project will assist the country in moving towards energy independence through utilisation of its sustainable local resources.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Note: Disbursement data provided is cumulative and covers disbursement made by the project Agency.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project will promote investment in innovative bioenergy technologies and practices associated with the use of agricultural residues and waste by enabling and developing sustainable bioenergy value chains leading to significant greenhouse gas emissions reductions and in support of Ukraine&#xE2;&#x20AC;&#x2122;s target to increase the renewable share of total power production in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
